# Phase 2 run: RF-DETR Small on data/full (595 classes), started from the pilot (runs/pilot-small).
# Read by train_job.sh when the job starts; change, commit, then -Action sync to apply while it waits.
# A resumed run keeps the epoch count it started with (train.py), because the cosine schedule is sized from it.
# Sizing for one 24 h job, keeping about 2.5 h for start-up, scoring 16,788 test images, export and margin:
# - A100: the full-speed test measured 55.6 images/s, about 53 min per epoch: 22 epochs (estimate ~19.5 h).
# - H100: the pilot ran 9.0 min per epoch on 49,418 images; scaled to 175,051 that is about 33 min: 36 epochs
#   (estimate ~20 h). Not measured on the full data yet.
EPOCHS=22
EPOCHS_A100=22
EPOCHS_H100=36
BATCH=16
ACCUM=1
START_FROM=runs/pilot-small/checkpoint_best_total.pth
